From: Dave Tapuska <dtapuska@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:13:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] [M156] Check for popup closure after user activation in
 WebPagePopupImpl

Original change's description:
> Check for popup closure after user activation in WebPagePopupImpl
>
> Notifying user activation from WebPagePopupImpl input handlers can
> invoke callbacks (such as Autofill observers) that synchronously close
> the popup or disconnect the widget host.
>
> This CL adds checks for the closing state immediately after
> NotifyUserActivation calls in WebPagePopupImpl to prevent further event
> processing on a closing popup. It also adds self-referencing
> scoped_refptrs during event dispatch to prevent premature destruction,
> along with unit tests covering widget disconnection during input
> handling.
>
